        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Eye Care Insurance & Payment Options",
          "html": "Eye Care Insurance &amp; Payment Options&nbsp;",
          "id": "9KITaJOIZk",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Insurance can feel confusing, but it doesn’t have to be. At Academy Vision, we help you understand what’s covered, what your options are, and how to make the most of your benefits.</p><p>Whether you’re using vision insurance, medical insurance, or paying out of pocket for <a href=\"/hours-location/\">eye care in Pine Beach</a>, we’ll walk you through everything so you know exactly what to expect.</p>",
          "id": "HyGy6znxjO",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
