          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Insurance details can get confusing, but that’s what we’re here for. Our team at Academy Vision will help verify your benefits, explain what’s covered, and make sure you’re getting the most out of your plan.</p><p>&nbsp;If something isn’t clear, we’ll walk you through it in a way that actually makes sense, so you feel confident before your visit.</p>",
